            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe nyene Tatenayi, umukuru w’intara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, na Shetari Bozenayi n’abo bari bafatanije baja aho bari barababaza bati: “Ni nde yabahaye uruhusha rwo gusubira kwubaka iyi Ngoro no gusanura aha hantu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bongera barababaza bati: “Ni ba nde bariko barubaka iyi nzu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko kubera inyonga z’Imana yabo zari kuri abo barongozi b’Abayuda, ntibahagaritse igikorwa kugeza bishikiriye Dariyusi na we akabishura kandi ikete ryiwe rikabashikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
